      "questEditorId": "MFSofVigAct1Controller",
      "prompt": "We just joined the Vigilants. Thoughts?",
      "responses": [
        "So we're the moral brigade now. Running around smashing things in the name of Stendarr.",
        "Me? Join? And wear that... grey... thing? I'm not putting that on. I glow, it clashes.",
        "...Fine. But if they make me swear an oath I'm going to need a drink first. A big one."
      ],
